# The source PDF for /naam. Untracked on purpose: this repo is public, and
# committing it publishes 172 pages of the family's name research. The committed
# text dump (src/data/naam/source-text.txt) is the input of record, and both
# hashes are asserted by scripts/naam/build-dataset.mjs.
